    <p>Brighton play Getafe in the UEFA Conference League (league phase, matchday 3) on <strong>Thursday 5 November 2026, kick-off 21:00 Madrid time (20:00 in the UK)</strong>, at the Coliseum in Getafe, south of Madrid.</p>
    <p>Staying in central Madrid, or heading out to Getafe later? Dubliners, an Irish pub on Calle de Espoz y Mina 7, just off Puerta del Sol, is a fans meeting point for Brighton fans. We show the match LIVE on the big projector and our 8 screens.</p>
